  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Lord Sky Crane answers Fang Zheng in a tunnel lined with rockman guards. He says the rockman slaves nurtured there are the best in Central Continent, and that even in treasure yellow heaven the owner’s wealth and influence sit far above mortal measure.",
      "chapters": [
        668
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_lord_sky_crane",
        "char_fang_zheng",
        "reg_central_continent",
        "loc_treasure_yellow_heaven"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At a sect discussion he drinks, smashes his wine bowl, and curses the other nine great ancient sects for obstructing Immortal Crane Sect over Hu Immortal blessed land. He tells He Feng Yang to succeed this time, leave the other sects no opening, and force them to beg to cooperate on guts Gu sales.",
      "chapters": [
        698
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "sect-pressure",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_immortal_crane_sect",
        "loc_hu_immortal_blessed_land",
        "char_he_feng_yang",
        "gu_guts_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In the depths of Fu Hu blessed land he opens his eyes when He Feng Yang’s arrangements fire. He spends immortal essence to send out rank six information path Immortal Gu Mutual Sense, borrowed by He Feng Yang from Lady Sang Xin, and the Gu descends over Fang Zheng at the blood pool.",
      "chapters": [
        699
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "activates-gu-to-track-fang-yuan",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_fu_hu_blessed_land",
        "gu_mutual_sense_immortal_gu",
        "char_lady_sang_xin"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "An anger will of Immortal Crane Sect’s third supreme elder stays in He Feng Yang’s immortal aperture during the Hu Immortal trip. He Feng Yang asks that will to use an immortal killer move again to break the battlefield, and the will spends red date immortal essence on expand space Immortal Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        703
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "anger-will-in-the-ambush",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fairy_bai_hu",
        "gu_expand_space_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Earlier, when rank five He Feng Yang chose to sacrifice himself to save the nine palace crane, Lord Tiger Demon was moved and saved both of them. After He Feng Yang became a Gu Immortal he joined Lord Tiger Demon’s faction.",
      "chapters": [
        704
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "faction-and-report",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After the ambush He Feng Yang returns injured to Fu Hu blessed land. Lord Tiger Demon stands beside an enormous stone pit watching tens of thousands of rockmen work, tells him to rest and heal, then reads the anger will’s report and sends fresh anger will to the conference hall on Fei He mountain. First and second supreme elder wills are already there with his own monitoring will.",
      "chapters": [
        704
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "faction-and-report",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_fei_he_mountain"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "His anger will argues that the ten great ancient sects are blocking the top of a volcano, with magma underneath that will eventually burst. He proposes agreeing to Fang Yuan’s conditions, acknowledging Hu Immortal blessed land as a sect subsidiary, identifying the ambushers, and joining the other nine sects in a wide scale immortal slaughtering plan. First supreme elder’s will says Combat Immortal Sect’s Shi Lei raised a similar plan years earlier and that Heavenly Court rejected it.",
      "chapters": [
        705
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "immortal-slaughtering-plan",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "fac_combat_immortal_sect",
        "char_shi_lei",
        "fac_heavenly_court"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He Feng Yang later remembers that without that help there would be no present He Feng Yang.",
      "chapters": [
        827
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "he-feng-yangs-debt",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "A Spirit Affinity House disciple’s explanation of Central Continent practice names Immortal Crane Sect’s third supreme elder as a demonic path Gu Immortal in his early years before the sect recruited him.",
      "chapters": [
        854
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "early-years",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_spirit_affinity_house"
      ]
    }
  ],
